# 若使用本仓库代码，请引用本仓库。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this repository."
title: "SweatUric-AI：汗液尿酸无创监测的因果机器学习分析管线"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SweatUric-AI team"        # 材料初评为盲审，成员姓名与单位不在仓库内披露
date-released: 2026-09-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hu305/sweaturic-causal-ml"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >
  Causal-assumption-guided machine-learning pipeline for non-invasive
  sweat uric-acid monitoring. Uses a DAG-first modelling paradigm
  (back-door adjustment sets, grouped cross-validation) to build
  statistically principled prediction models. Ships only with
  synthetic, schema-compatible demo data; the reported metrics
  validate the code, not any device or clinical performance.
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - directed acyclic graph
  - sweat uric acid
  - GroupKFold
  - synthetic data
